  "Farm output, input, and total factor productivity indices for the United States, and the relative productivity levels of the 48 contiguous States, published by the USDA Economic Research Service.": "USDA 经济研究局发布的美国农业产出、投入与全要素生产率指数，以及 48 个本土州的相对生产率水平。",
  "Get tables from the quarterly Treasury Bulletin - offerings, ownership distribution, currency and coin, foreign currency positions, the Exchange Stabilization Fund, and internal revenue receipts.": "获取季度财政部公报的各表格 — 发行、持有人分布、货币与硬币、外币头寸、外汇平准基金及国内税收收入。",
  "Profile of a single federal award recipient from USAspending.gov - identity, location, totals, top awarding agencies, federal accounts, assistance listings, and geography, plus its child recipients.": "USAspending.gov 上单个联邦受款方的资料 — 身份、位置、总额、主要拨款机构、联邦账户、援助目录与地理分布，及其子受款方。",
