  "Public and private agricultural and food research and development expenditures in the United States, in current and constant dollars with the R&D price index, published by the USDA Economic Research Service.": "USDA 经济研究局发布的美国公共与私人农业食品研发支出，含现价与不变价及研发价格指数。",
